                    $R_html[] = array('DESCRIPTION_HTML' => 'The Hypertext Transfer Protocol 
(HTTP) is an application-level 
protocol for distributed, 
collaborative, hypermedia 
information systems. 

<div ' . $css_data['line_break'] . '><br><br></div>
It is a generic, stateless, 
protocol which can be used for
