specify --disable-cgi in 
your configure line.

<div ' . $css_data['line_break'] . '><br><br></div>
Because both --enable-cli 
and --enable-cgi are 
enabled by default, simply 
having --enable-cli in 
your configure line does 
not necessarily mean the 
CLI will be copied as 
{PREFIX}/bin/php during 
make install.

<div ' . $css_data['line_break'] . '><br><br></div>
The CLI binary is 
